  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att ge befolkningen i de baltiska l&#xe4;nderna m&#xf6;jlighet att genom massmedia f&#xe5; tillg&#xe5;ng till relevant information om EUs institutioner, politik mm, likas&#xe5; om de kommande f&#xf6;rhandlingarna ang&#xe5;ende framtida medlemskap i EU. Insatsen omfattar utbildning av journalister fr&#xe5;n Estland, Lettland och Litauen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to enable the populations of the Baltic countries to, through massmedia, access relevant information about the institutions, policies etc. of the EU, as well as info.abouttheir forthcoming negotiations for future membership in the European Union. Training will be provided to journalists from the Balt. countr.</narrative>
  </description>
